Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: mips/filter_msa_intrinsics.c
Line: 388
Function: png_read_filter_row_up_msa
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: Tail handling reads 64 bytes with LD_UB4 when only 49–63 bytes remain, overreading both the current row and prev_row by up to 15 bytes.

Source context:
```c
